{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 14296086160128615555,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "LiteX hardware",
      "source_hash": 8201663600241768259,
      "context_hash": 14861329240186619563,
      "translation": "LiteX 하드웨어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This directory contains some experiments, extending the default LiteX SOC for ULX3S.",
      "source_hash": 3988815068294729682,
      "context_hash": 15501515642092482248,
      "translation": "이 디렉터리는 ULX3S용 기본 LiteX SOC를 확장하는 몇 가지 실험을 담고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ESP32",
      "source_hash": 17638018680394053175,
      "context_hash": 9212250909495292708,
      "translation": "ESP32",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The ULX3S has an on-board ESP32 with a Wifi antenna, connected to the SDCard.",
      "source_hash": 325568003257760760,
      "context_hash": 13974907897883414513,
      "translation": "ULX3S에는 Wifi 안테나가 달린 온보드 ESP32가 SDCard에 연결되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It can be used to directly send files on the SDCard using FTP through wifi (by executing a FTP server on the ESP32 written in MicroPython).",
      "source_hash": 10620644554134736189,
      "context_hash": 5714699365480983747,
      "translation": "이를 이용하면 (MicroPython으로 작성된 FTP 서버를 ESP32에서 실행하여) Wifi를 통한 FTP로 SDCard에 파일을 직접 전송할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "See [this link](https://github.com/emard/esp32ecp5) for instructions on how to install Micropython on the ESP32 and configure Wifi.",
      "source_hash": 3906300614036255177,
      "context_hash": 9991019945632300408,
      "translation": "ESP32에 Micropython을 설치하고 Wifi를 설정하는 방법은 [이 링크](https://github.com/emard/esp32ecp5)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The SDCard connector is shared between the ESP32 and the FPGA (ECP5).",
      "source_hash": 4295966073035826788,
      "context_hash": 11879060219306310325,
      "translation": "SDCard 커넥터는 ESP32와 FPGA(ECP5)가 공유합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Only one of them can access the SDCard at a time (the other one goes high impedance).",
      "source_hash": 17413529840657148613,
      "context_hash": 2377176712827771284,
      "translation": "둘 중 하나만 한 번에 SDCard에 접근할 수 있습니다(다른 쪽은 고임피던스 상태가 됩니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "To trigger the ESP32 on and off, I have added a command to LiteOS (`esp32 <on|off>`).",
      "source_hash": 8284652423525977675,
      "context_hash": 17978646695852364255,
      "translation": "ESP32를 켜고 끄기 위해, LiteOS에 명령어(`esp32 <on|off>`)를 추가했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "It works as follows:",
      "source_hash": 12028172934635539603,
      "context_hash": 15188835237643319591,
      "translation": "동작 방식은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A pin of the FPGA (`F1`, called `wifi_en`) controls the ESP32.",
      "source_hash": 5444481623180982099,
      "context_hash": 17833262357411571935,
      "translation": "FPGA의 핀(`F1`, `wifi_en`이라 불림) 하나가 ESP32를 제어합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "If it is low, then the ESP32 is inactive (and goes high impedance), then the FPGA can access the SDCard.",
      "source_hash": 15026508423927989279,
      "context_hash": 9433037634366629009,
      "translation": "이 핀이 로우(low)이면 ESP32는 비활성 상태가 되고(고임피던스로 전환됨), 그러면 FPGA가 SDCard에 접근할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Then, it is very easy to create a LiteX module that lets software control the pin through a CSR (Control and Status Register).",
      "source_hash": 6106154466806762413,
      "context_hash": 10028097014905810080,
      "translation": "그러면 소프트웨어가 CSR(제어 및 상태 레지스터, Control and Status Register)을 통해 그 핀을 제어할 수 있게 해주는 LiteX 모듈을 만드는 것은 매우 간단합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "Note: here we mean a CSR that controls LiteX hardware (not to be confused with RiscV internal CSRs, this is a completely different thing):",
      "source_hash": 2556330656009292236,
      "context_hash": 7138339439759476153,
      "translation": "참고: 여기서 말하는 CSR은 LiteX 하드웨어를 제어하는 CSR을 뜻합니다(RiscV 내부 CSR과 혼동하지 마십시오, 이것은 완전히 다른 것입니다):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "It inherits `Module` (hardware component for our SoC) and `AutoCSR` (manages memory mapping and support libraries for CSRs automagically !).",
      "source_hash": 2991417042637844264,
      "context_hash": 17528305997470041024,
      "translation": "이 모듈은 `Module`(우리 SoC의 하드웨어 컴포넌트)과 `AutoCSR`(CSR에 대한 메모리 매핑과 지원 라이브러리를 자동으로 관리함!)을 상속합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The module is created by a new function of `BaseSoC`:",
      "source_hash": 15332676772296521064,
      "context_hash": 6126455641859283465,
      "translation": "이 모듈은 `BaseSoC`의 새 함수에 의해 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The LiteX build system automatically creates functions to query, set, reset the new CSR.",
      "source_hash": 8923947959734611073,
      "context_hash": 7955567435141542682,
      "translation": "LiteX 빌드 시스템은 새 CSR을 조회, 설정, 초기화하는 함수들을 자동으로 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Examining the file `build/radiona_ulx3s/software/include/generated/csr.h`, one can find new functions to query and to set our new CSR:",
      "source_hash": 11075192186008058649,
      "context_hash": 743273086281339648,
      "translation": "`build/radiona_ulx3s/software/include/generated/csr.h` 파일을 살펴보면, 우리의 새 CSR을 조회하고 설정하는 새 함수들을 찾을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Then we can activate the ESP32 by software, by calling `esp32_enable_write(1)`.",
      "source_hash": 8531398850813198976,
      "context_hash": 17165920690545675663,
      "translation": "그러면 `esp32_enable_write(1)`을 호출하여 소프트웨어로 ESP32를 활성화할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "But wait a minute, if we do so, both the ESP32 and FPGA will be connected to the SDCard.",
      "source_hash": 9543006704645878911,
      "context_hash": 13035306698901204111,
      "translation": "하지만 잠깐, 그렇게 하면 ESP32와 FPGA가 둘 다 SDCard에 연결된 상태가 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:2",
      "source": "We also need to set the FPGA pins connected to the SDCard to high impedance.",
      "source_hash": 5752083835994902111,
      "context_hash": 16559940916249553181,
      "translation": "SDCard에 연결된 FPGA 핀들도 고임피던스 상태로 설정해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:3",
      "source": "LiteX has an option to support high impedance on the SDCard driver:",
      "source_hash": 7897576973902424225,
      "context_hash": 14577609217819914666,
      "translation": "LiteX에는 SDCard 드라이버에서 고임피던스를 지원하는 옵션이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "This creates a `spisdcard_tristate` signal in the SOC, that puts the pins in high impedance state if asserted.",
      "source_hash": 14868388896658241655,
      "context_hash": 6103051466722061311,
      "translation": "이렇게 하면 SOC에 `spisdcard_tristate` 신호가 생성되며, 이 신호가 어서트(assert)되면 핀들이 고임피던스 상태가 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "We need to connect it to the CSR, as follows:",
      "source_hash": 14703308966601638533,
      "context_hash": 15893925646795374386,
      "translation": "다음과 같이 이를 CSR에 연결해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "(of course, if it is written like that, `add_spi_sdcard()` needs to be called before `add_ESP32()`).",
      "source_hash": 9845820244847134842,
      "context_hash": 10108715224082778609,
      "translation": "(물론 이렇게 작성하면, `add_ESP32()`보다 `add_spi_sdcard()`를 먼저 호출해야 합니다.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Now we just need to add the following command to LiteOS:",
      "source_hash": 418323621889725686,
      "context_hash": 17826553840032530676,
      "translation": "이제 다음 명령어를 LiteOS에 추가하기만 하면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "notes:",
      "source_hash": 4828869156687876675,
      "context_hash": 13082805668588410497,
      "translation": "참고 사항:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "in addition to generating the `xxx_write()`,`xxx_read()` functions, LiteX also generates a `CSR_XXX_BASE` macro that lets conditionally compile code depending on whether a CSR was generated in the hardware.",
      "source_hash": 17911284712637901244,
      "context_hash": 17887100070128314402,
      "translation": "`xxx_write()`, `xxx_read()` 함수를 생성하는 것 외에도, LiteX는 하드웨어에 해당 CSR이 생성되었는지 여부에 따라 코드를 조건부로 컴파일할 수 있게 해주는 `CSR_XXX_BASE` 매크로도 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "the SDCard needs to be re-initialized when ESP32 is switched off (because the ESP32 may have left it in a state that is not expected by LiteX BIOS).",
      "source_hash": 5551667222050569826,
      "context_hash": 7983185182594179434,
      "translation": "ESP32가 꺼질 때 SDCard를 다시 초기화해야 합니다(ESP32가 LiteX BIOS가 예상하지 못한 상태로 SDCard를 남겨두었을 수 있기 때문입니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Blitter",
      "source_hash": 6901524281671391404,
      "context_hash": 3565553495886577963,
      "translation": "Blitter",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:04.946150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "LiteX has a nice integrated frame buffer, that can display 640x480x24bpp.",
      "source_hash": 11110742681673022838,
      "context_hash": 7329893326061322034,
      "translation": "LiteX에는 640x480x24bpp를 표시할 수 있는 훌륭한 통합 프레임 버퍼가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.049069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It uses the LiteDRAM SDRAM controller and its interface to easily create DMA devices.",
      "source_hash": 1535891833251607681,
      "context_hash": 12855529896068767051,
      "translation": "이는 LiteDRAM SDRAM 컨트롤러와 그 인터페이스를 사용하여 DMA 장치를 쉽게 만듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.049070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "To set pixels, one directly writes data in the SDRAM (the framebuffer is mapped at address `0x40c00000`).",
      "source_hash": 13405898297796137786,
      "context_hash": 17956334989855130151,
      "translation": "픽셀을 설정하려면 SDRAM에 데이터를 직접 씁니다(프레임버퍼는 `0x40c00000` 주소에 매핑되어 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.049070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "For instance, the following loop clears the screen:",
      "source_hash": 15741411157880372780,
      "context_hash": 12835438283370120887,
      "translation": "예를 들어 다음 루프는 화면을 지웁니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.049070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "If you have a sophisticated core, like VexRiscV, that has pipelining and branch prediction, this will not take much more than a couple of cycles per pixel, but it is another story if you use one a minimalistic core (such as mine), or even smaller one (like SERV).",
      "source_hash": 18214761013638001104,
      "context_hash": 7030403500858454177,
      "translation": "파이프라이닝과 분기 예측 기능을 갖춘 VexRiscV 같은 정교한 코어를 사용한다면 픽셀당 몇 사이클 이상 걸리지 않겠지만, (제 것과 같은) 미니멀한 코어나 (SERV처럼) 그보다 더 작은 코어를 사용한다면 이야기가 달라집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.049070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Then the idea is to add a small device, that will set pixels for you at maximal speed (up to two pixels per cycle, since SDRAM can operate at up to 2x CPU frequency in LiteX).",
      "source_hash": 9779942184856274793,
      "context_hash": 3885949534323035731,
      "translation": "그래서 착안한 아이디어는 최대 속도로 픽셀을 설정해 줄 작은 장치를 추가하는 것입니다(LiteX에서 SDRAM은 CPU 주파수의 최대 2배로 동작할 수 있으므로, 사이클당 최대 두 픽셀까지 가능합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.049070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "I was completely amazed to see how easy it is to design such a device in LiteX: there is a `LiteDRAMDMAWriter` that can do that for you.",
      "source_hash": 14577479383071815795,
      "context_hash": 12207343827944625089,
      "translation": "LiteX에서 이런 장치를 설계하는 것이 얼마나 쉬운지 보고 완전히 놀랐습니다: 이를 대신해 줄 `LiteDRAMDMAWriter`가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.049070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "The `LiteDRAMDMAWriter` can be configured through CSRs:",
      "source_hash": 7223558618421108581,
      "context_hash": 12605965073602979005,
      "translation": "`LiteDRAMDMAWriter`는 CSR을 통해 설정할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.049070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "CSR",
      "source_hash": 6951657245244237197,
      "context_hash": 3559442135643759984,
      "translation": "CSR",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
